WEBVTT

01:29.600 --> 01:33.070
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.780 --> 01:36.259
[Episode 8]

01:36.800 --> 01:38.120
Golden Cave Guessing Game.

01:38.120 --> 01:38.960
Round one.

01:41.240 --> 01:41.920
Begin.

01:46.200 --> 01:47.729
Golden Cave Guessing Game.

01:47.870 --> 01:49.190
What exactly is it?

02:05.760 --> 02:06.560
Can she really

02:06.560 --> 02:08.360
tell the dice by sound?

02:19.079 --> 02:20.120
Please, God,

02:20.120 --> 02:22.000
watch over me.

02:22.020 --> 02:23.720
Buddha, Bodhisattva Guanyin,

02:23.720 --> 02:24.570
I beg you.

02:24.590 --> 02:26.520
No more touching once it's shaken.

02:40.079 --> 02:40.880
Open it.

03:04.400 --> 03:05.880
I survived.

03:05.880 --> 03:07.360
I survived!

03:06.710 --> 03:09.240
[Token]

03:12.720 --> 03:14.140
I survived.

03:15.720 --> 03:17.720
What good are last-minute prayers?

03:17.840 --> 03:19.170
When your luck is bad,

03:19.280 --> 03:20.880
even the gods can't save you.

03:21.590 --> 03:22.579
I'm doomed.

03:23.440 --> 03:25.000
You must have made a mistake.

03:25.000 --> 03:25.840
Let go of me!

03:25.840 --> 03:26.820
Let me go!

03:26.850 --> 03:27.730
Let me go!

03:27.840 --> 03:29.980
Let go! Let go of me!

03:36.079 --> 03:37.000
Stay away.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.400
Don't come any closer.

03:38.420 --> 03:39.420
Stay back,

03:39.450 --> 03:40.810
or I won't go easy on you!

03:40.920 --> 03:41.780
Stay back!

03:41.870 --> 03:42.750
Let me go!

03:44.240 --> 03:45.320
You've made a mistake.

03:45.320 --> 03:47.200
Did you grab the wrong person?

03:48.000 --> 03:49.120
Let me go!

03:49.480 --> 03:50.520
Dao.

03:53.740 --> 03:54.960
Don't be afraid.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.400
I clearly won.

03:56.400 --> 03:58.040
Why are you killing me?

03:58.060 --> 03:59.450
Because you're stupid.

03:59.480 --> 04:01.280
You're not following the rules.

04:01.280 --> 04:03.280
My roll was clearly higher.

04:03.390 --> 04:05.560
Are you sure you understand the rules?

04:05.880 --> 04:07.650
Please, don't kill me.

04:07.680 --> 04:10.580
I can stay here
and serve you like a slave.

04:10.910 --> 04:11.760
Me too.

04:11.760 --> 04:12.400
Me too.

04:12.400 --> 04:13.710
Please don't kill me.

04:13.740 --> 04:15.540
Then as you wish.

04:17.870 --> 04:20.470
Send them to the underworld
to serve as slaves.

04:20.760 --> 04:21.630
No!

04:21.660 --> 04:22.780
Don't kill me!

04:22.800 --> 04:23.800
No!

04:24.010 --> 04:25.830
No!

04:28.760 --> 04:30.160
What are you waiting for?

04:30.760 --> 04:31.960
Begin.

04:36.680 --> 04:38.330
Aren't we comparing the rolls?

04:38.330 --> 04:39.520
I actually survived.

04:39.520 --> 04:40.370
Right.

04:40.730 --> 04:42.550
My roll was lower than hers.

04:42.750 --> 04:44.100
I thought I was done for.

04:45.560 --> 04:47.320
Do you remember what that man said?

04:47.320 --> 04:48.360
The dice decide the winner.

04:48.360 --> 04:49.159
Not that part.

04:49.840 --> 04:50.640
Could it be...

04:50.840 --> 04:53.000
The mute servant will announce the winner.

04:53.000 --> 04:53.930
That's the part.

04:54.120 --> 04:55.880
So you mean

04:56.720 --> 04:57.990
our victory or defeat

04:58.020 --> 04:59.520
is decided by the mute servant?

04:59.520 --> 05:00.470
Yes.

05:01.110 --> 05:03.590
Then how does the mute servant
know who wins?

05:03.610 --> 05:06.530
So our lives are in their hands?

05:06.760 --> 05:08.020
Then how do we beat this game?

05:08.020 --> 05:09.620
I haven't figured it out yet.

05:09.800 --> 05:11.360
I need to watch a little longer.

05:11.360 --> 05:13.480
Maybe I'll find a way through.

05:17.120 --> 05:19.680
Master, the new minted coins are here.

05:19.720 --> 05:20.920
Please inspect them.

05:30.250 --> 05:31.410
Well done.

05:32.320 --> 05:33.590
With these,

05:34.450 --> 05:35.850
it won't be long before

05:36.080 --> 05:37.159
the world

05:37.320 --> 05:39.350
belongs to Lingya Tower.

05:42.370 --> 05:44.610
[Long Live Lingya]

05:52.440 --> 05:54.700
Round two of the Golden Cup Guessing Game

05:55.080 --> 05:55.800
begins.

06:16.480 --> 06:17.010
[Token]

06:18.640 --> 06:21.000
The token has different patterns
on each side.

06:21.000 --> 06:21.960
Come on.

06:36.080 --> 06:38.010
No more touching once it's shaken.

06:48.159 --> 06:49.120
Murder!

06:52.360 --> 06:53.680
Why did she kill again?

06:53.680 --> 06:55.400
Weren't the rules clear?

06:55.840 --> 06:57.240
Only one person can win.

06:57.280 --> 06:59.170
So as long as
she gets rid of her opponent,

06:59.170 --> 07:00.540
no matter the outcome,

07:00.840 --> 07:02.000
she survives.

07:02.020 --> 07:04.280
Looks like there are no rules here at all.

07:05.400 --> 07:06.200
To win,

07:07.000 --> 07:08.320
she'll do anything.

07:09.280 --> 07:11.280
Good thing I wasn't paired with her.

07:11.360 --> 07:13.720
Who exactly is this woman?

07:14.280 --> 07:17.160
I heard
she's a centurion of the Chilian Clan.

07:17.680 --> 07:19.360
The number of people who died at her hands

07:19.360 --> 07:21.760
might be more than
the people who died here.

07:23.600 --> 07:25.030
Are we continuing or not?

07:25.280 --> 07:26.160
Begin.

07:39.040 --> 07:39.880
Hey.

07:40.310 --> 07:41.750
Why haven't you opened it yet?

07:41.750 --> 07:43.150
What are you waiting for?

07:52.980 --> 07:54.020
Five.

07:54.970 --> 07:57.100
[Token]

07:57.700 --> 07:59.110
[Token]

07:59.150 --> 08:00.680
The smooth side means high.

08:00.710 --> 08:02.370
So the other side means low.

08:02.840 --> 08:05.910
[Token]

08:04.510 --> 08:06.420
Dao bet on low.

08:08.100 --> 08:09.240
That's my dice!

08:09.270 --> 08:09.900
Give it back!

08:09.900 --> 08:11.170
I won! I won!

08:11.200 --> 08:12.000
My dice!

08:12.000 --> 08:13.080
You two bet on low.

08:13.100 --> 08:14.530
I won!

08:15.120 --> 08:16.000
Looks like

08:16.160 --> 08:17.040
one of you

08:17.040 --> 08:19.240
has figured out the rules.

08:20.210 --> 08:21.810
You've got the wrong person!

08:21.920 --> 08:23.280
There's nothing in her dice!

08:23.280 --> 08:24.410
I should have won!

08:24.440 --> 08:25.880
I should have won!

08:26.200 --> 08:28.280
No, my hat!

08:28.400 --> 08:31.200
-You've got the wrong person!
-My hat! My hat!

08:32.960 --> 08:34.020
Let me go!

08:34.240 --> 08:35.419
Let me go!

08:36.059 --> 08:36.900
Hat!

08:37.090 --> 08:38.590
My hat!

08:56.320 --> 08:57.360
Are you okay?

08:57.380 --> 08:58.440
I'm fine.

08:58.460 --> 08:59.020
Here.

09:04.980 --> 09:05.820
Thank you.

09:13.690 --> 09:14.490
Sis.

09:16.410 --> 09:18.030
You were bitten by a snake.

09:18.160 --> 09:19.000
Are you okay?

09:19.130 --> 09:19.890
I'm fine.

09:20.020 --> 09:20.910
Guards.

09:21.200 --> 09:22.280
Take her away

09:22.280 --> 09:23.400
and lock her up for two hours.

09:23.400 --> 09:24.240
Why?

09:24.840 --> 09:25.720
What are you doing?

09:25.720 --> 09:26.650
Don't come here!

09:27.200 --> 09:29.160
She disrupted the order,

09:29.320 --> 09:30.650
so she must be punished.

09:30.760 --> 09:32.640
If you interfere again,

09:32.720 --> 09:34.780
I'll throw you into the snake pit too.

09:35.870 --> 09:36.910
Dao.

09:37.640 --> 09:38.630
It's fine.

09:38.680 --> 09:39.410
Don't worry.

09:47.820 --> 09:48.870
Nan Yanzhi.

09:49.060 --> 09:50.020
Don't worry.

09:51.760 --> 09:52.960
What a pity.

09:53.640 --> 09:56.170
She probably
won't make it through the night.

09:56.280 --> 09:57.400
What do you mean?

10:00.560 --> 10:02.480
Dao, what does that mean?

10:02.580 --> 10:04.060
What do we do now?

10:59.760 --> 11:00.840
Master.

11:03.040 --> 11:04.240
Master.

11:07.800 --> 11:09.880
I knew you would come to save me.

11:10.160 --> 11:11.820
How many times have I told you?

11:11.840 --> 11:13.760
The prisoners in Lingya Tower
are all serious criminals.

11:13.760 --> 11:14.960
You can't trust them so easily.

11:14.960 --> 11:17.120
Today, for someone you barely know,

11:17.120 --> 11:18.320
you risked your life.

11:18.480 --> 11:20.140
Are you trying to drive me mad?

11:21.160 --> 11:22.120
But

11:30.760 --> 11:31.920
you also said

11:32.320 --> 11:35.040
entering Lingya Tower
means almost certain death.

11:35.040 --> 11:36.190
If that's the case,

11:36.320 --> 11:38.650
then I need real friends.

11:40.360 --> 11:42.520
So you were foolish enough
to risk your life

11:42.520 --> 11:43.640
to make friends?

11:45.000 --> 11:47.320
Do you know how dangerous
the snakes down there are?

11:47.320 --> 11:48.600
Good thing I was here.

11:49.280 --> 11:50.800
Otherwise, you wouldn't even

11:50.800 --> 11:52.530
be able to get out of here today.

11:56.760 --> 11:58.760
Are these snakes really that venomous?

11:58.760 --> 12:00.560
But I still haven't found
my mother's antidote.

12:00.560 --> 12:01.490
What should I do?

12:07.080 --> 12:08.520
But don't worry.

12:08.980 --> 12:10.560
The snake venom isn't fatal.

12:10.560 --> 12:11.840
It only knocks people out,

12:11.840 --> 12:12.970
as if they were dead.

12:13.560 --> 12:14.920
Once the toxin wears off,

12:14.920 --> 12:15.960
you will be fine.

12:19.760 --> 12:21.240
It's not venomous?

12:21.640 --> 12:23.470
Master, why didn't you say so?

12:23.800 --> 12:25.080
You scared me to death.

12:25.640 --> 12:27.440
If I don't teach you a lesson now,

12:27.520 --> 12:28.920
you'll never learn.

12:30.800 --> 12:32.530
I can't watch over you forever.

12:33.160 --> 12:34.820
I have important things to do.

12:37.000 --> 12:37.760
Right.

12:39.080 --> 12:40.880
If the people
thrown into the Ten Thousand Snake Pit

12:40.880 --> 12:41.950
didn't die,

12:42.640 --> 12:43.960
where did they go?
